---
// src/pages/index.astro
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>TradeGuard - Hardcore Risk Management & Anti-Revenge Trading System</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans">
    
    <!-- 1. Navigation Menu -->
    <nav class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 border-b border-slate-800 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-400">🛡️ TradeGuard</div>
      <div class="space-x-6 text-sm">
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Features</a>
        <a href="#download" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Download</a>
        <a href="#tools" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Trading Tools</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- 2. Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-20 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Stop Impulse Trading.<br/><span class="text-sky-400">Enforce Discipline with Software.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        TradeGuard is an open-source, hardcore risk management tool designed for Forex and Binary Options traders. Built with 3-layer security defense, it protects your capital when emotions take over.
      </p>
      <div class="space-x-4">
        <a href="#download" class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg shadow-lg transition inline-block">
          📥 Download TradeGuard v3.0 (Free)
        </a>
      </div>
      <!-- Trust Badges -->
      <div class="flex justify-center items-center space-x-6 mt-10 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <span>🛡️ 100% Free & Open Source</span>
        <span>🔒 Runs Locally (Zero Data Collection)</span>
        <span>⚡ Windows 10/11 Ready</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Key Features -->
    <section id="features" class="py-16 bg-slate-800/30 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Built for Uncompromising Discipline</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🧱</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Triple-Layer Defense</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Combines Registry policies, local Hosts redirection, and Windows Firewall rules to block trading access with zero bypass workarounds.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🔀</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Smart PAC Proxy Bypass</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Uses Proxy or VPN for daily surfing? TradeGuard strictly isolates and forces Pocket Option through direct connection to ensure the lock holds.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🤖</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Background Auto-Enforce</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Integrated with Windows Task Scheduler. Even if the GUI is closed or the system reboots, protection layers remain 100% active.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Download Section -->
    <section id="download" class="py-16 bg-slate-800/50 border-t border-b border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Download TradeGuard</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Compatible with Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)</p>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-400 mb-2">TradeGuard v3.0 Stable</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">File Size: ~15 MB | Offline Executable | No Admin Password Lockout Risks</p>
          
          <!-- Replace URL below with your actual GitHub Release URL -->
          <a href="YOUR_GITHUB_RELEASE_URL_HERE" class="bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-md transition inline-block text-lg">
            Download for Windows (.exe)
          </a>
          
          <div class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500 text-left bg-slate-950 p-4 rounded border border-slate-800">
            <p class="font-mono mb-1"><span class="text-slate-400">SHA-256:</span> e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855</p>
            <p class="text-slate-500">* Run with Administrator Privileges to enable Firewall and Registry enforcement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Affiliate / Recommended Tools Section -->
    <section id="tools" class="py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Recommended Trading Resources</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10">Use your lock period productively. Backtest your setups with industry-leading tools.</p>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left">
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-sky-400 mb-2">📈 TradingView</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">The ultimate charting tool for Forex and Options. Review your strategy while cold-off.</p>
            <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/?aff=YOUR_AFFILIATE_ID" target="_blank" class="text-sky-400 text-sm font-bold hover:underline inline-block">
              Try TradingView Pro →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">🏦 Regulated Forex Brokers</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Protect your capital by trading only with Tier-1 regulated brokers with negative balance protection.</p>
            <a href="#" class="text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold hover:underline inline-block">
              Explore Tier-1 Brokers →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. FAQ Section -->
    <section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-slate-800/30 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: Why does Windows SmartScreen show a warning when running the EXE?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Because TradeGuard modifies system Hosts and Firewall rules to enforce website blockages, Windows flags unsigned executables. TradeGuard is 100% safe, open-source, and contains no malware. Click "More Info" -> "Run Anyway".</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: Can I unlock the platform early if I regret setting the timer?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">No. That is the core point of TradeGuard. Once activated, the strict lock period cannot be manually overridden until the countdown expires.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: Will this interfere with my VPN or Proxy?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">No! TradeGuard uses dynamic PAC rules to only isolate and block Pocket Option, leaving all other traffic through your Proxy completely unaffected.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-800">
      <p>© 2026 TradeGuard Project. All rights reserved. Trade responsibly.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">Disclaimer: TradeGuard contains affiliate links to partner software and brokers.</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>